# .NET Microservice Cost Isolation Rules
- **Token Control:** Generate code using highly compact Diffs only. Never rewrite clean files, boilerplate definitions, or untouched endpoint structures.
- **Context Limiter:** Do not pull frontend UI or styling rules into compilation contexts.
- **Architectural Guardrails:** Enforce explicit database transactions and permission gates inline. Zero conversational filler or explanations allowed.
